<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}</p>

<p>Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},</p>

<p>Thank you for taking the time to contact the Qantas Customer Care team about your experience at {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If Dangerous Goods Complaint add</em></strong><br />
<br />
<strong>Safety is our number one priority</strong><br />
<br />
It's important that your baggage complies with our dangerous goods policy. This makes it easier for us to provide you with a safe flying experience.<br />
<br />
The details on ‘dangerous goods’ are stated clearly on our website and provided prior to your boarding. The rules around <em><strong>&lt;item being taken on board&gt;</strong></em> are strict, and I understand your disappointment when it had to be <em><strong>&lt;checked-in, surrendered etc&gt;</strong></em>.<br />
<br />
Our customers’ wellbeing is at the core of everything we do and we never compromise on safety.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If no space in overhead add</strong></em><br />
<br />
<strong>Storage limitations onboard</strong><br />
<br />
We always strive to accommodate our customers’ needs, but we have to keep in mind storage limitations on board, and we need to limit the amount of carry-on in the aircraft cabin.<br />
<br />
There are times when our crew will have to move things around to make adequate space. When this happens, we really appreciate our customers understanding.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If Previously allowed add</strong></em><br />
<br />
I saw in your feedback that you weren’t stopped with your overweight bags at {{{Case.Departure_Airport_Code__c}}}, so I apologise if our staff didn’t apply our baggage rules consistently. &nbsp;<br />
<br />
Our Airport Manager in {{{Case.Departure_Airport_Code__c}}} will want to address this with the relevant staff members there, so thank you for bringing it to our attention.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If staff were rude add</strong></em><br />
<br />
I'm sorry to hear that our staff weren’t as courteous as expected.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
I wanted to assure you that I’ve passed your feedback on to our Airport Management to take up with the staff working on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>